ote: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HAND MADE IN LATVIA', 'dev.Scarf', 'Natural materials', 'Handcrafted' from public.products pr where pr.slug = 'studio-natural-double-layered-linen-scarf-in-light-blue-50x200cm';
