otos can be purchased in the placemat section . Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HANDMADE IN LATVIA', 'dev.Table runners', 'Natural materials', 'Handcrafted' from public.products pr where pr.slug = 'studio-natural-double-layered-linen-table-runner-in-blue-50x200-cm';
