insert into public.product_translations (product_id, locale, name, description, story, craft, materials, technique) select pr.id, 'en', 'Linen mohair throw in green and gray 135x190 cm', 'Elevate your relaxation experience with our exquisite handwoven linen mohair throw with hand-twisted fringes. Crafted with precision and passion, this throw embodies the perfect blend of sophistication and comfort. The copper thread woven into the fabric gives the throw a light shine. Immerse yourself in the sumptuous softness of pure linen, complemented by the gentle warmth of mohair. The meticulous handwoven design not only adds a touch of artisanal charm to your space but also ensures a unique, high-quality piece that stands the test of time. ---split--- Color: Green+gray+pink Dimensions: width 135 cm, length 190 cm Composition: 40 % linen, 30% mohair, 20% silk, 10% lurex Product reference: LZ m Rombi greenmix+graycoppermoh+pink +KFR Care instructions: Hand wash (max 30°C) or dry clean. Delicate detergent recommended. As this fabric is 100% handmade it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HANDMADE IN LATVIA', 'Elevate your relaxation experience with our exquisite handwoven linen mohair throw with hand-twisted fringes. Crafted with precision and passion, this throw embodies the perfect blend of sophistication and comfort. The copper thread woven into the fabric gives the throw a light shine. Immerse yourself in the sumptuous softness of pure linen, complemented by the gentle warmth of mohair. The meticulous handwoven design not only adds a touch of artisanal charm to your space but also ensures a unique, high-quality piece that stands the test of time. ---split--- Color: Green+gray+pink Dimensions: width 135 cm, length 190 cm Composition: 40 % linen, 30% mohair, 20% silk, 10% lurex Product reference: LZ m