uct color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HAND MADE IN LATVIA 100 % MADE IN EUROPE', 'dev.Napkin', 'Natürliche Materialien', 'Handgefertigt' from public.products pr where pr.slug = 'studio-natural-linen-napkin-with-velet-edge-50x50-cm';
insert into public.product_translations (product_id, locale, name, description, story, craft, materials, technique) select pr.id, 'en', 'Linen napkin with embroidery Tinita 50x50 cm', 'Sheer and light hand woven linen napkin in pastel aubergine and mint green colored embroidery. Excellent to add some glam to the table with a floral design. ---split--- Color: Pastel aubergine Dimensions: width 50 cm, length 50 cm Composition: 100% linen Product reference: Tinita +mint/aubergine + puder + m5 Care instructions: Hand wash (max 30° C) or dry clean. If hand-washed, do not wring or twist - remove excess water by shaking it out. Do not tumble dry. Iron at maximum (high) temperature. Cockle is the very special effect of this fabric. As this fabric is 100% hand made it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Direct sunlight and strong lighting may alter the color of the fabric. Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. The place-mat in the photo can be purchased in the PLACEMATS section. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HAND MADE IN LATVIA', 'Sheer and light hand woven linen napkin in pastel aubergine and mint green colored embroidery. Excellent to add some glam to the table with a floral design. ---split--- Color: Pastel aubergine Dimensions: width 50 cm, length 50 cm Composition: 100% linen Product reference: Tinita +mint/aubergine + puder + m5 Care instructions: Hand wash (max 30° C) or dry clean. If hand-washed, do not wring or twist - remove excess water by shaking it out. Do not tumble dry. Iron at maximum (high) temperature. Cockle is the very special effect of this fabric. As this fabric is 100% hand made it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Direct sunlight and strong lighting may alter the color of the fabric. Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. The place-mat in the photo can be purchased in the PLACEMATS section. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HAND MADE IN LATVIA', 'dev.napkin', 'Natural materials', 'Handcrafted' from public.products pr where pr.slug = 'studio-natural-linen-napkin-in-pastel-aubergine';
