insert into public.product_translations (product_id, locale, name, description, story, craft, materials, technique) select pr.id, 'en', 'Linen placemat with pocket 50x40 cm', 'Elevate your dining experience with our handwoven linen placemats. Made from natural materials, these elegant placemats add a touch of sophistication to any dining table. Expertly handcrafted with attention to detail, these placemats are perfect for both formal and casual occasions. These placemats are detailed with crocheted pockets and a handmade hem-stitch design. Invest in quality for your home with our linen placemats. ---split--- Color: Natural+yellow Dimensions: width 50 cm, length 40 cm Composition: 100% linen Product reference: Ieva nat+gelb+2hs+tamb kab+g5 Care instructions: Machine wash (max 30°C) using a gentle cycle, hand wash (max 30°C) or dry clean. Wash separately. Iron at maximum (high) temperature. Cockle is the very special effect of this fabric. As this fabric is 100% handmade it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Direct sunlight and strong lighting may alter the color of the fabric. Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. The matching napkin in the photo can be purchased in the napkin section . Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HANDMADE IN LATVIA', 'Elevate your dining experience with our handwoven linen placemats. Made from natural materials, these elegant placemats add a touch of sophistication to any dining table. Expertly handcrafted with attention to detail, these placemats are perfect for both formal and casual occasions. These placemats are detailed with crocheted pockets and a handmade hem-stitch design. Invest in quality for your home with our linen placemats. ---split--- Color: Natural+yellow Dimensions: width 50 cm, length 40 cm Composition: 100% linen Product reference: Ieva nat+gelb+2hs+tamb kab+g5 Care instructions: Machine wash (max 30°C) using a gentle 