nd strong lighting may alter the color of the fabric. Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. The napkins in the photo can be purchased in the napkins section . Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL', 'dev.Table runners', 'Natural materials', 'Handcrafted' from public.products pr where pr.slug = 'studio-natural-table-runner-silver';
