ttings. Matching napkins can be purchased in the napkins section. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HAND MADE IN LATVIA', 'dev.Table cloth', 'Natürliche Materialien', 'Handgefertigt' from public.products pr where pr.slug = 'studio-natural-linen-tablecloth-transparent-160x220-cm-170x220-cm';
insert into public.product_translations (product_id, locale, name, description, story, craft, materials, technique) select pr.id, 'en', 'Linen tablecloth Transparent 160x300 cm', 'Semi-sheer hand woven linen tablecloth with special salt and pepper effect. This tablecloth has a specially handmade 10cm hemstitch . ---split--- Color: Natural + anthracite Dimensions: width 160cm, l ength 300cm Composition: 100% linen Product reference: Transparent nat+antr+4Hs+m10 Care instructions: Hand wash (max 30°C) or dry clean. If hand-washed, do not wring or twist - remove excess water by shaking it out. Do not tumble dry. Iron at maximum (high) temperature. Cockle is the very special effect of this fabric. As this fabric is 100% hand made it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Direct sunlight and strong lighting may alter the color of the fabric. Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. Similar design and different color napkins can be purchased in the napkins section. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HAND MADE IN LATVIA', 'Semi-sheer hand woven linen tablecloth with special salt and pepper effect. This tablecloth has a specially handmade 10cm hemstitch . ---split--- Color: Natural + anthracite Dimensions: width 160cm, l ength 300cm Composition: 100% linen Product reference: Transparent nat+antr+4Hs+m10 Care instructions: Hand wash (max 30°C) or dry clean. If hand-washed, do not wring or twist - remove excess water by shaking it out. Do not tumble dry. Iron at maximum (high) temperature. Cockle is the very special effect of this fabric. As this fabric is 100% hand made it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Direct sunlight and strong lighting may alter the color of the fabric. Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. Similar design and different color napkins can be purchased in the napkins section. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HAND MADE IN LATVIA', 'dev.Table cloth', 'Natural materials', 'Handcrafted' from public.products pr where pr.slug = 'studio-natural-dev-160x300-cm';
