insert into public.product_translations (product_id, locale, name, description, story, craft, materials, technique) select pr.id, 'de', 'Linen trench coat', 'Hand woven linen trench coat with highest quality silk lining. The coat has a linen belt and a hidden clasp with linen buttons. Can be safely crumpled in a bag. Unique and very highest quality designer''s work. Limited edition. ---split--- Color: Lavender Size: Women''s M / EU 38 / UK 10 (the model is size S/M and is 173 cm tall) Composition: 100% linen, lining 100% silk Product reference: Ieva M krekl oberg+kiwi+silk Care instructions: Dry clean only. We do not recommend ironing to maintain the crease effect. Cockle is the very special effect of this fabric. As this fabric is 100% hand made it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Direct sunlight and strong lighting may alter the color of the fabric. Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HANDMADE IN LATVIA', 'Hand woven linen trench coat with highest quality silk lining. The coat has a linen belt and a hidden clasp with linen buttons. Can be safely crumpled in a bag. Unique and very highest quality designer''s work. Limited edition. ---split--- Color: Lavender Size: Women''s M / EU 38 / UK 10 (the model is size S/M and is 173 cm tall) Composition: 100% linen, lining 100% silk Product reference: Ieva M krekl oberg+kiwi+silk Care instructions: Dry clean only. We do not recommend ironing to maintain the crease effect. Cockle is the very special effect of this fabric. As this fabric is 100% hand made it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Direct sunlight and strong lighting may alter the color of the fabric. Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HANDMADE IN LATVIA', 'dev.Coat', 'Natürliche