 customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HANDMADE IN LATVIA', 'dev.Throw', 'Natural materials', 'Handcrafted' from public.products pr where pr.slug = 'studio-natural-linen-wool-throw-trinis-140x175-cm';
insert into public.product_translations (product_id, locale, name, description, story, craft, materials, technique) select pr.id, 'de', 'Linen wool throw Trinis 140x175 cm', 'Very warm handwoven throw from linen and high-quality alpaca wool detailed with hand-twisted fringes. Linen boucle thread combined with wool in a special technique gives this throw a unique texture and a thread with small sequins endows it with a slight shine. A great accessory to put around your shoulders on chilly evenings. ---split--- Color: Natural Dimensions: width 140 cm, length 175 cm Composition: 60% linen, 30% alpaca, 10% lurex Product reference: Trinis 2R nat+beige/oldgoldmix wool/nat buckle+g2 coralgold+KFR Care instructions: Hand wash (max 30°C) or dry clean. Delicate detergent recommended. As this fabric is 100% handmade it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. The blanket in the photo can be purchased in the throws section. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HANDMADE IN LATVIA', 'Very warm handwoven throw from linen and high-quality alpaca wool detailed with hand-twisted fringes. Linen boucle thread combined with wool in a special technique gives this throw a unique texture and a thread with small sequins endows it with a slight shine. A great accessory to put around your shoulders on chilly evenings. ---split--- Color: Natural Dimensions: width 140 cm, length 175 cm Composition: 60% linen, 30% alpaca, 10% lurex Product reference: Trinis 2R nat+beige/oldgoldmix wool/nat buckle+g2 coralgold+KFR Care instructions: Hand wash (max 30°C) or dry clean. Delicate detergent recommended. As this fabric is 100% handmade it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. The blanket in the photo can be purchased in the throws section. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HANDMADE IN LATVIA', 'dev.Throw', 'Natürliche Materialien', 'Handgefertigt' from public.products pr where pr.slug = 'studio-natural-linen-wool-throw-trinis-140x175-cm';
insert into public.product_translations (product_id, locale, name, description, story, craft, materials, technique) select pr.id, 'en', 'Linen wool throw Trinis 95x210 cm', 'Soft and very warm handwoven throw made from linen, silk and high quality wool blend with knitted plaits along the shorter sides. ---split--- Color: Beige Dimensions: width 95cm, l ength 210cm Composition: 35% linen, 25% alpaca, 20% cashmere, 20% silk Product reference: LZ Trinis puder+puder/grmistr wool +2g pines Care instructions: H and wash (max 30°C) or dry clean. Delicate detergent recommended. As this fabric is 100% hand made it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HANDMADE IN LATVIA', 'Soft and very warm handwoven throw made from linen, silk and high quality wool blend with knitted plaits along the shorter sides. ---split--- Color: Beige Dimensions: width 95cm, l ength 210cm Composition: 35% linen, 25% alpaca, 20% cashmere, 20% silk Product reference: LZ Trinis puder+puder/grmistr wool +2g pines Care instructions: H and wash (max 30°C) or dry clean. Delicate detergent recommended. As this fabric is 100% hand made it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HANDMADE IN LATVIA', 'dev.Throw', 'Natural materials', 'Handcrafted' from public.products pr where pr.slug = 'studio-natural-dev-linen-wool-throw-lz-trinis-95x205-cm';
