f the filling is required, please contact us. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HANDMADE IN LATVIA', 'dev.Pillow', 'Natürliche Materialien', 'Handgefertigt' from public.products pr where pr.slug = 'studio-natural-quilted-linen-cushion-in-cream-50x50-cm';
insert into public.product_translations (product_id, locale, name, description, story, craft, materials, technique) select pr.id, 'en', 'Reversible double layer tablecloth in 160x200', 'Our exquisite double-layer tablecloth with a decorative square in the middle is handwoven from high-quality linen for a luxurious touch. The double-layer fabric not only adds depth and texture to your table setting, but is also sustainable. This linen tablecloth is perfect for round tables and is a must-have for an elegant and eco-friendly home. ---split--- Color: Charcoal grey Dimensions: width 160m, l ength 200cm Composition : 100% linen Product reference: DUBL+ g5 ANTR + NAT + ANTR KW Care instructions: Hand wash (max 30°C) or dry clean. If hand washed, do not wring or twist - remove excess water by shaking it out. Do not tumble dry. Iron at maximum (high) temperature. Cockle is the very special effect of this fabric. As this fabric is 100% handmade it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HAND MADE IN LATVIA', 'Our exquisite double-layer tablecloth with a decorative square in the middle is handwoven from high-quality linen for a luxurious touch. The double-layer fabric not only adds depth and texture to your table setting, but is also sustainable. This linen tablecloth is perfect for round tables and is a must-have for an elegant and eco-friendly home. ---split--- Color: Charcoal grey Dimensions: width 160m, l ength 200cm Composition : 100% linen Product reference: DUBL+ g5 ANTR + NAT + ANTR KW Care instructions: Hand wash (max 30°C) or dry clean. If hand washed, do not wring or twist - remove excess water by shaking it out. Do not tumble dry. Iron at maximum (high) temperature. Cockle is the very special effect of this fabric. As this fabric is 100% handmade it may have some knots or natural unevenness. Warning: Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. Note: Products can be customized, please contact us! STUDIO NATURAL HAND MADE IN LATVIA', 'dev.Table cloth', 'Natural materials', 'Handcrafted' from public.products pr where pr.slug = 'studio-natural-double-layer-tablecloth-in-160x200';
